</blockquote>$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmsi6jmh6003j04l561pyehmv/how-to-choose-maple-wood-kitchen-cabinet-content-0.webp$gct$]::text[], $gct$2026-08-09T15:25:00.955+00:00$gct$, $gct$Maple wood kitchen cabinets cost $2,500 to $6,000 per linear foot and offer a tight, paintable grain ideal for NYC renovations. Here is how to choose the right grade, finish, and construction method for your space.$gct$, $gct$how-to-choose-maple-wood-kitchen-cabinets-in-nyc$gct$, $gct$795eb6b1-cca0-458f-9847-ca76a72fa5c4$gct$, $gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmsi6jmh6003j04l561pyehmv/how-to-choose-maple-wood-kitchen-cabinet-cover.webp$gct$, $gct$Maple kitchen cabinets cost $2,500-$6,000/linear foot. But the grade and finish you pick changes everything. Avoid these 3 costly mistakes before ordering.$gct$, $gct$Maple Wood Kitchen Cabinets: NYC Selection Guide 2026$gct$, $gct$how-to-choose-maple-wood-kitchen-cabinets-in-nyc$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$maple wood kitchen$gct$, $gct$maple kitchen cabinets$gct$, $gct$custom kitchen cabinets$gct$, $gct$NYC renovation$gct$, $gct$sustainable cabinetry$gct$]::text[], $gct$How to Choose Maple Wood Kitchen Cabinets in NYC$gct$, $gct$2026-08-09T15:25:02.188664+00:00$gct$),
