</blockquote>$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmsi6js97003n04l5f4oyqj95/what-is-a-custom-made-cabinet-a-2026-buy-content-0.webp$gct$]::text[], $gct$2026-08-15T16:50:01.381+00:00$gct$, $gct$A custom made cabinet is built to exact space dimensions with buyer-selected materials and joinery. In NYC's humidity and pre-war layouts, stock cabinetry fails predictably. Here is what custom actually costs and why it lasts.$gct$, $gct$what-is-a-custom-made-cabinet-a-2026-buyer-s-guide$gct$, $gct$7e0bcb82-0c77-4a9f-a59e-33de8809e1a3$gct$, $gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmsi6js97003n04l5f4oyqj95/what-is-a-custom-made-cabinet-a-2026-buy-cover.webp$gct$, $gct$Custom made cabinets cost more upfront but outlast stock 4:1 in NYC humidity. Material data, build process, and real 2026 pricing — see what actually lasts.$gct$, $gct$What Is a Custom Made Cabinet? 2026 NYC Buyer's Guide$gct$, $gct$what-is-a-custom-made-cabinet-a-2026-buyer-s-guide$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$custom made cabinet$gct$, $gct$custom kitchen cabinets$gct$, $gct$NYC cabinetry$gct$, $gct$sustainable cabinetry$gct$, $gct$Brooklyn kitchen design$gct$]::text[], $gct$What Is a Custom Made Cabinet? A 2026 Buyer's Guide$gct$, $gct$2026-08-15T16:50:02.577051+00:00$gct$),
