</blockquote>$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmss6num5009304kzzynx6coi/amish-custom-kitchen-cabinets-vs-nyc-cra-content-0.webp$gct$]::text[], $gct$2026-08-19T13:10:06.939+00:00$gct$, $gct$Amish custom kitchen cabinets and NYC craftsmen like Green Cabinets NY use the same solid hardwoods and dovetail joinery. The real difference is logistics, lead times, and whether your Brooklyn co-op can handle a delivery truck from Lancaster County.$gct$, $gct$amish-custom-kitchen-cabinets-vs-nyc-craftsmen-real-differences$gct$, $gct$2ab077c1-7089-4ac1-a281-65919316a817$gct$, $gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmss6num5009304kzzynx6coi/amish-custom-kitchen-cabinets-vs-nyc-cra-cover.webp$gct$, $gct$Amish cabinets use solid hardwood and dovetail joinery, but NYC shops match that quality while cutting lead times. The real differences are logistics, not wood. See the comparison.$gct$, $gct$Amish Custom Kitchen Cabinets vs NYC Craftsmen (2026)$gct$, $gct$amish-custom-kitchen-cabinets-vs-nyc-craftsmen-real-differences$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$amish custom kitchen cabinets$gct$, $gct$custom kitchen cabinets NYC$gct$, $gct$custom millwork$gct$, $gct$sustainable cabinetry$gct$, $gct$Brooklyn kitchen renovation$gct$]::text[], $gct$Amish Custom Kitchen Cabinets vs NYC Craftsmen: Real Differences$gct$, $gct$2026-08-19T13:10:08.013548+00:00$gct$),
