</blockquote>$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmt26pj8q001g05l37261ilz9/how-to-pick-a-kitchen-tile-backsplash-th-content-0.webp$gct$]::text[], $gct$2026-08-25T13:45:01.378+00:00$gct$, $gct$The backsplash is the last surface to go in and the first one the eye lands on. This guide walks through matching tile scale, grout color, and material to your cabinet finish family — so the millwork stays the star.$gct$, $gct$how-to-pick-a-kitchen-tile-backsplash-that-works-with-custom-cabinets$gct$, $gct$5743e3d1-85f3-4c5f-886c-5dd8ed565df8$gct$, $gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmt26pj8q001g05l37261ilz9/how-to-pick-a-kitchen-tile-backsplash-th-cover.webp$gct$, $gct$5 steps to match backsplash tile to custom cabinets — finish family, tile scale, grout color, and 7 ideas for kitchen tile backsplash that won't overwhelm your millwork.$gct$, $gct$Kitchen Tile Backsplash Ideas for Custom Cabinets$gct$, $gct$how-to-pick-a-kitchen-tile-backsplash-that-works-with-custom-cabinets$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$backsplash design$gct$, $gct$custom cabinets$gct$, $gct$kitchen renovation$gct$, $gct$NYC kitchens$gct$, $gct$tile selection$gct$]::text[], $gct$How to Pick a Kitchen Tile Backsplash That Works With Custom Cabinets$gct$, $gct$2026-08-25T13:45:03.71987+00:00$gct$),
