</blockquote>$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmswgxvfi001f04l3csnoy72t/home-depot-custom-kitchen-cabinets-vs-br-content-0.webp$gct$]::text[], $gct$2026-08-25T18:00:01.554+00:00$gct$, $gct$Home Depot's 'custom' cabinet program is semi-custom modular, not built-to-measure. Here's how it compares to a Brooklyn custom builder on cost, quality, and fit for NYC kitchens.$gct$, $gct$home-depot-custom-kitchen-cabinets-vs-brooklyn-custom-builders$gct$, $gct$3ee1e69c-88b6-43b1-95e0-b6a021c93311$gct$, $gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmswgxvfi001f04l3csnoy72t/home-depot-custom-kitchen-cabinets-vs-br-cover.webp$gct$, $gct$Home Depot's custom cabinets are semi-custom modular, not built-to-measure. The real cost, quality, and timeline differences for NYC kitchens, compared side by side.$gct$, $gct$Home Depot Custom Kitchen Cabinets vs Brooklyn Builders$gct$, $gct$home-depot-custom-kitchen-cabinets-vs-brooklyn-custom-builders$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$custom kitchen cabinets$gct$, $gct$home depot cabinets$gct$, $gct$brooklyn custom cabinets$gct$, $gct$nyc kitchen renovation$gct$, $gct$semi-custom vs custom$gct$]::text[], $gct$Home Depot Custom Kitchen Cabinets vs. Brooklyn Custom Builders$gct$, $gct$2026-08-25T18:00:03.47351+00:00$gct$),
