</blockquote>$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmt3ma6l2001f04junogi30cs/is-a-custom-bathroom-vanity-worth-it-for-content-0.webp$gct$]::text[], $gct$2026-08-26T14:15:01.519+00:00$gct$, $gct$Stock vanities come in fixed widths. NYC bathrooms do not care. A custom bathroom vanity fits the exact dimensions of your space, lasts 15 to 20 years, and costs less over a decade than replacing a warped stock vanity twice.$gct$, $gct$is-a-custom-bathroom-vanity-worth-it-for-nyc-homes$gct$, $gct$ed2c90a4-3793-4cfe-8def-8a4d5381ea7b$gct$, $gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmt3ma6l2001f04junogi30cs/is-a-custom-bathroom-vanity-worth-it-for-cover.webp$gct$, $gct$A custom bathroom vanity costs $2,500-$6,000 but lasts 20 years. Stock fails in 8. Here's why NYC homes need custom, and when they don't.$gct$, $gct$Custom Bathroom Vanity NYC: Worth It? (2026 Guide)$gct$, $gct$is-a-custom-bathroom-vanity-worth-it-for-nyc-homes$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$custom bathroom vanity$gct$, $gct$sustainable bathroom vanity NYC$gct$, $gct$NYC bathroom renovation$gct$, $gct$custom cabinets Brooklyn$gct$, $gct$bathroom vanity materials$gct$]::text[], $gct$Is a Custom Bathroom Vanity Worth It for NYC Homes?$gct$, $gct$2026-08-26T14:15:02.598056+00:00$gct$),
