</blockquote>$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmtnmct31001h04jn8gv9jr91/custom-built-kitchen-cabinets-vs-big-box-content-0.webp$gct$]::text[], $gct$2026-09-07T13:10:01.502+00:00$gct$, $gct$Stock cabinets cost $75 to $300 per linear foot. Custom-built runs $500 to $1,200+. But the real difference shows up in 3 to 5 years, when edge banding lifts, drawer bottoms sag, and filler strips waste 15 percent of your storage. Here is what the big-box quote does not include.$gct$, $gct$custom-built-kitchen-cabinets-vs-big-box-the-real-difference$gct$, $gct$233c6e51-e594-4fa4-b4aa-f954ea51158e$gct$, $gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmtnmct31001h04jn8gv9jr91/custom-built-kitchen-cabinets-vs-big-box-cover.webp$gct$, $gct$Custom-built kitchen cabinets cost $500-$1,200/linear foot vs. $75-$300 for stock. The $15K gap buys 25 years vs. 7. Here's what the quote hides.$gct$, $gct$Custom-Built Kitchen Cabinets vs. Big-Box: Real Difference$gct$, $gct$custom-built-kitchen-cabinets-vs-big-box-the-real-difference$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$custom-built kitchen cabinets$gct$, $gct$custom kitchen cabinets cost$gct$, $gct$semi-custom kitchen cabinets$gct$, $gct$Brooklyn kitchen renovation$gct$, $gct$sustainable cabinetry$gct$, $gct$NYC custom cabinets$gct$]::text[], $gct$Custom-Built Kitchen Cabinets vs. Big-Box: The Real Difference$gct$, $gct$2026-09-07T13:10:02.368271+00:00$gct$),
