</blockquote>$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmu0hcmuf003j04l2q889tjfa/cheap-custom-kitchen-cabinets-what-nyc-b-content-0.webp$gct$]::text[], $gct$2026-09-15T14:00:08.663+00:00$gct$, $gct$Cheap custom kitchen cabinets in NYC range from $500 to $1,200+ per linear foot, but the quality gap between vendors is enormous. Here's how to spot what buyers actually get.$gct$, $gct$cheap-custom-kitchen-cabinets-what-nyc-buyers-actually-get$gct$, $gct$d6675624-8702-4236-aa3d-405c59d0b9f4$gct$, $gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmu0hcmuf003j04l2q889tjfa/cheap-custom-kitchen-cabinets-what-nyc-b-cover.webp$gct$, $gct$$15,000 gap between stock and custom kitchen cabinets. 5 questions that separate real custom from relabeled semi-custom. Avoid these vendor traps.$gct$, $gct$Cheap Custom Kitchen Cabinets: NYC Buyer's Guide 2026$gct$, $gct$cheap-custom-kitchen-cabinets-what-nyc-buyers-actually-get$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$custom kitchen cabinets$gct$, $gct$cheap custom cabinets$gct$, $gct$NYC kitchen renovation$gct$, $gct$Brooklyn cabinetry$gct$, $gct$semi-custom cabinets$gct$]::text[], $gct$Cheap Custom Kitchen Cabinets: What NYC Buyers Actually Get$gct$, $gct$2026-09-15T14:00:09.293364+00:00$gct$),
