</blockquote>$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmuahemt3001f04l9aijulxgs/what-custom-kitchen-cabinets-at-home-dep-content-0.webp$gct$]::text[], $gct$2026-09-22T13:40:02.711+00:00$gct$, $gct$Home Depot's "custom" kitchen cabinets are actually semi-custom, built in standard increments that fight NYC's irregular apartment walls. Here's what big-box cabinetry misses and when a Brooklyn custom builder is the smarter investment.$gct$, $gct$what-custom-kitchen-cabinets-at-home-depot-actually-miss$gct$, $gct$57bb014c-ebf7-4e48-b91f-c0cd5a2289b1$gct$, $gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmuahemt3001f04l9aijulxgs/what-custom-kitchen-cabinets-at-home-dep-cover.webp$gct$, $gct$Custom kitchen cabinets Home Depot sells are semi-custom, not bespoke. NYC homeowners lose on fit, materials, and longevity. See the real cost comparison inside.$gct$, $gct$Custom Kitchen Cabinets Home Depot Misses (2026 Guide)$gct$, $gct$what-custom-kitchen-cabinets-at-home-depot-actually-miss$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$custom kitchen cabinets home depot$gct$, $gct$semi-custom cabinets$gct$, $gct$custom cabinetry NYC$gct$, $gct$Brooklyn kitchen renovation$gct$, $gct$sustainable cabinetry$gct$]::text[], $gct$What Custom Kitchen Cabinets at Home Depot Actually Miss$gct$, $gct$2026-09-22T14:04:44.044892+00:00$gct$),
