</blockquote>$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmuq779we001g04jvn612zgdl/what-is-a-kitchen-and-bathroom-showroom--content-0.webp$gct$]::text[], $gct$2026-10-03T13:55:02.19+00:00$gct$, $gct$A kitchen and bathroom showroom is a design laboratory, not a retail store. Here is what NYC homeowners and developers should expect, what to bring, and why skipping the visit costs more than it saves.$gct$, $gct$what-is-a-kitchen-and-bathroom-showroom-a-2026-guide$gct$, $gct$4c27b210-2eca-4a5c-be33-274156f5c738$gct$, $gct$https://pub-766d8c5d35924c0bb4b6c0c1facea1b6.r2.dev/articles/cmuq779we001g04jvn612zgdl/what-is-a-kitchen-and-bathroom-showroom--cover.webp$gct$, $gct$70% of young homeowners pay more for sustainable cabinets. A showroom visit prevents the 5 most costly custom cabinetry mistakes. Here is what to ask.$gct$, $gct$What Is a Kitchen and Bathroom Showroom? 2026 Guide$gct$, $gct$what-is-a-kitchen-and-bathroom-showroom-a-2026-guide$gct$, ARRAY[$gct$bathroom kitchen showrooms$gct$, $gct$custom kitchen cabinets$gct$, $gct$NYC renovation$gct$, $gct$Brooklyn design$gct$, $gct$sustainable cabinetry$gct$]::text[], $gct$What Is a Kitchen and Bathroom Showroom? A 2026 Guide$gct$, $gct$2026-10-03T13:55:03.192929+00:00$gct$)
